# Red Mage's Rapier {1}{R}, cast on turn 1: job select makes a 1/1 colorless Hero token and attaches the Equipment to it, so the
# Hero is a Wizard as well and has "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn" (CR 702.182,
# 613.1d, 613.1f). A creature spell (Memnite) does not pump it; each noncreature spell (Mox Sapphire, then Mox Emerald) does,
# 1 to 3 to 5 (CR 603.2). Bot2's Mox Ruby on its own turn does not (it is Bot2's spell, not "you cast"), and the pump has worn
# off by then.

